(7698975, 1263405, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the beams of light and shadows playing in the hills.  Wish I didn''t have to look so hard to see them.  A sacrifice in width to pull those hills in closer may have paid off.  The cloud foreground, for me, doesn''t add anything except a distraction.</td>', 'I like the beams of light and shadows playing in the hills.  Wish I didn''t have to look so hard to see them.  A sacrifice in width to pull those hills in closer may have paid off.  The cloud foreground, for me, doesn''t add anything except a distraction.', '2021-08-14 22:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698976, 1263386, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, YES!  Awesome.  Wonderful color, cloud play, and of course the flying formation.  Nicely seen and captured.</td>', 'Oh, YES!  Awesome.  Wonderful color, cloud play, and of course the flying formation.  Nicely seen and captured.', '2021-08-14 22:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
