(7698982, 1263361, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation and overall processing choice.  Kind of do wish for some true whites in here but the sepia works ok too.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice presentation and overall processing choice.  Kind of do wish for some true whites in here but the sepia works ok too.  Good luck.', '2021-08-14 22:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
