(7699203, 1263408, 30214, '<td valign="top">Yes, the misalignment of the sun and the lighthouse shadow is fun :). Where did you launch your drone from? I imagine, not from the shore, seems too far, although it may be another panorama distortion.... Congrats on HM!</td>', 'Yes, the misalignment of the sun and the lighthouse shadow is fun :). Where did you launch your drone from? I imagine, not from the shore, seems too far, although it may be another panorama distortion.... Congrats on HM!', '2021-08-18 16:06:13.000000', NULL, 0),
