(7699205, 1263386, 30214, '<td valign="top">Very nice image Wendy, congrats on your ribbon! For me, for this particular challenge, it lacked depth a little bit. I myself was searching for a shot that communicates a huge depth of field. I know that sky is vast and limitless, it''s just my visual impression that here it repesents a nice (but somewhat flat) background for the birds.</td>', 'Very nice image Wendy, congrats on your ribbon! For me, for this particular challenge, it lacked depth a little bit. I myself was searching for a shot that communicates a huge depth of field. I know that sky is vast and limitless, it''s just my visual impression that here it repesents a nice (but somewhat flat) background for the birds.', '2021-08-18 16:11:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7699208, 1263408, 19825, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Yes, the misalignment of the sun and the lighthouse shadow is fun :). Where did you launch your drone from? I imagine, not from the shore, seems too far, although it may be another panorama distortion.... Congrats on HM! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I launched from shore -- it is not nearly as far away as it appears to be. The Chicago Harbor Lighthouse is a few hundred yards off the end of Navy Pier.</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Yes, the misalignment of the sun and the lighthouse shadow is fun :). Where did you launch your drone from? I imagine, not from the shore, seems too far, although it may be another panorama distortion.... Congrats on HM!  I launched from shore -- it is not nearly as far away as it appears to be. The Chicago Harbor Lighthouse is a few hundred yards off the end of Navy Pier.', '2021-08-18 17:28:49.000000', NULL, 0),
